Nice shopping.
The food is good!
I still trust Amazon's self-sold products more. Now, it's very convenient to buy from overseas. The logistics time is just a few days longer than that of domestic delivery. I have to say that Amazon's clearance ability from overseas to China is very strong. It is much faster than going through transshipment. So now, I buy many things from overseas on Amazon.
It is hoped that the quality and price of domestic goods will improve. Many things are produced domestically, but it is cheaper to go out and buy them than at home, and we hope that this will improve.
